  "id": "20a2dbac-85fd-49cb-8ffa-ea87affdfa38",
  "title": "Black Knight - Leveling Tank",
  "description": "[overview]\nCredit to Kai on Discord for the stat and gearing guidance.\n\n[stats]\n**Agility>Stamina>AP>Hit**\n\nAgility is the primary stat and provides significantly more value than attack power because many abilities and features scale with it. Gear similarly to a hunter. Spell power offers limited benefit, but it should not be prioritized.\n\n[gear]\n[1K Needles - Centaur Mining Axe - Req. LVL 26](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523460982914023464/WoWScrnShot_070526_184624.jpg?ex=6a5b5a5a&is=6a5a08da&hm=99a6a053ecee8592a982721a38d9b6b98e1950d7297249e669939779ec5a9be1&)\n[Desolace - Bone Harvester - Req. LVL 35](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523461096416215040/WoWScrnShot_070526_184420.jpg?ex=6a5b5a75&is=6a5a08f5&hm=1033ca7764e6eb79bb0d296b1aa37b879d346274d5363a651243d4487174ca68&)\n[Tanaris - Executioner's Axe - Req. LVL 41](https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523461171947245608/WoWScrnShot_070526_184430.jpg?ex=6a5b5a87&is=6a5a0907&hm=01e661589ad22309ed33747b707b0832f5721770915bb2508b7ebebbfc3e4150&)\n[Ungoro Crater - Zamael's Corrupted Twilight - Req. LVL 45](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523461228201115718/WoWScrnShot_070526_184743.jpg?ex=6a5b5a95&is=6a5a0915&hm=95e73ec276ae5a6c3ab44ebac2aae71816eadd9637975e93b75fbd33c1c2906d&=&format=webp&width=1522&height=856)\n[Ungoro Crater - Cogbolt's Special - Req. LVL 48](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523461275072466994/WoWScrnShot_070526_184749.jpg?ex=6a5b5aa0&is=6a5a0920&hm=d8c8fa6a4411e483a4223ed8e02f4868ddbe9e575cf24ccf38333fc275c9d4ad&=&format=webp&width=1522&height=856)\n[Burning Stepps - The Final Strike - Req. LVL 55](https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1522587101814722641/1523461371973341276/WoWScrnShot_070526_184705.jpg?ex=6a5b5ab7&is=6a5a0937&hm=ecf6faaa088ef4d651e9accaab30edfb2e06821177661727c3d9e8a4d017a40d&=&format=webp&width=1522&height=856)\n\n[leveling]\nLevels 1–9 are slow and fairly standard, so pull one mob at a time.\nFrom 10–20, Houndmaster is the strongest choice because the hound deals serious damage and serves as a temporary meat shield. It can level to 60, but efficiency drops after level 20, especially against elite quests where the hound dies too quickly.\n \n**Around level 21 is when i made the swap to Black Knight.**",
